# 091 · Needs you shows a rig that is stuck

**Status:** `DROPPED`, merged into [246](246-home-and-decisions.goal) · **Version:** [v0.3.0](../roadmap.md#v030)

## What

**Needs you** on the home page, and its count in the left nav, show a rig that is stuck, with what is wrong in words and a link to its page:

- a rig launched on RunPod that has not enrolled some minutes after its pod runs (the pod's log on its page says why; it costs money meanwhile);
- a rig whose setup, start or image update failed, or waits longer than it should;
- a rig whose last report is old (stale) while it has runs that should be at work;
- a rig whose isolation check at start failed, or whose model check fails so that its agents are stopped.

Each item says what it costs while it waits (a RunPod pod's price per hour), and goes away by itself once the rig is well.

## Why

The owner, 2026-10-22, with a rig on RunPod whose pod restarted every few seconds and never enrolled: "currently "needs you" home doesn't show anything for this starting up rig being stuck. So I'd have no idea it was broken unless I went to rigs to look."

## Done when

- [ ] Each case above shows in Needs you, with its words and link, and leaves once fixed.
- [ ] Tests for each case, and for the count.
- [ ] The pages that describe Needs you.

## Decisions

- 2026-10-22, owner: a bug fix for v0.1.1.
- 2026-10-24, owner: v0.1.1 becomes the code clean-up; this goal moves to v0.1.4, the UI clean-up and UX improvements.
- 2026-11-09, the owner: v0.2.0 ships what was built ("cut v0.2.0 with what changes we have now"); this goal, not started, moves to v0.3.0 with the new features.
- 2026-11-10, the owner, with the v0.3.0 plan (goal [242](_completed/242-v030-review.goal)): merged into [246](246-home-and-decisions.goal). It is built in the new dashboard, with goal 246.

## Open questions

- How many minutes a launched pod may take to enroll before it shows (its image pull can take several).

## Progress

- 2026-10-22: Goal written from the owner's feedback.
- 2026-11-10: Merged into goal 246.

